  "body": "Hi\r\n\r\ni would like synapse to support mariadb as a database. i use mariadb for several other docker images. it would be more resource-saving if you don't have to use different databases.\r\n\r\nis there anything against using mariadb? sqlite would also be supported by my other dockers, but is not as performant with synapse.\r\n\r\nwould it be implementable?\r\n",
